        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add nfc permission compatibility data]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30736</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30736"/>
        <updated>2026-10-04T22:01:20.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Add the missing <code class="notranslate">nfc</code> permission descriptor to <code class="notranslate">api/Permissions.json</code>.</li>
<li>Reuses browser support and status metadata from the existing <code class="notranslate">api/NDEFReader.json</code> entry (supported on Chrome for Android from version 89).</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Defined in the W3C Web NFC specification under <a href="https://w3c-cg.github.io/web-nfc/#obtaining-permission" rel="nofollow">Obtaining permission</a> ("The Web NFC API is a default powerful feature which is identified by the powerful feature/name <code class="notranslate">nfc</code>").</li>
<li>Present in Chromium IDL: <code class="notranslate">third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl</code>.</li>
<li>Matches existing Web NFC metadata and passes consistency checks (<code class="notranslate">webview_android: false</code> matching <code class="notranslate">api.Permissions</code>).</li>
<li>All local linters and unit tests (<code class="notranslate">npm run fix</code>, <code class="notranslate">npm test</code>) passed.</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">Addresses the <code class="notranslate">nfc</code> checklist item in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2616274291" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831">#24831</a>.</p>]]></content>
