        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Clear-Site-Data: Mark cookies directive as partial in Safari]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30735</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30735"/>
        <updated>2026-10-04T21:53:33.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Update <code class="notranslate">http.headers.Clear-Site-Data.cookies</code> for Safari to mark it as <code class="notranslate">partial_implementation: true</code> with a note that only cookies matching the response host are cleared.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Safari removes only cookies whose domain exactly matches the response host; cookies set with a <code class="notranslate">Domain</code> attribute are kept, which diverges from the Clear-Site-Data specification requiring registrable domain cookie clearing.</li>
<li>Documented and tracked in WebKit bug 325085 (<a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325085" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325085</a>).</li>
<li>Root cause identified in WebKit source (<code class="notranslate">NetworkStorageSession::deleteCookies</code> in <code class="notranslate">Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/cocoa/NetworkStorageSessionCocoa.mm</code>), where host-exact matching (<code class="notranslate">domain == String(cookie.domain)</code>) is used.</li>
<li>Tested and reproduced on macOS Safari and iOS/iPadOS Safari.</li>
<li>All local linter and unit tests (<code class="notranslate">npm run fix</code>, <code class="notranslate">npm test</code>) passed.</li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30649.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5561726736" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649">#30649</a></p>]]></content>
