        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix(webextensions): add menus.update property compatibility data]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30694</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30694"/>
        <updated>2026-09-28T21:25:56.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/185269030?u=1fc22565ccf4566b6f734fabaa87e03d9a31cfe4&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Summary</h3>
<p dir="auto">Adds the missing compatibility data for the following <code class="notranslate">menus.update()</code> properties:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">icons</code> — Firefox 64</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">viewTypes</code> — Firefox 64</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">visible</code> — Firefox 63</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">The compatibility data was added after investigating the Firefox WebExtensions implementation and documentation, Firefox release notes, and the related Mozilla Bugzilla issues.</p>
<p dir="auto">The Firefox version information is based on the following sources:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">menus.update.visible</code> — Firefox 63, based on Firefox 63 release information and <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1482529" rel="nofollow">Bug 1482529</a>.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">menus.update.icons</code> — Firefox 64, based on Firefox 64 release information and <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1414566" rel="nofollow">Bug 1414566</a>.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">menus.update.viewTypes</code> — Firefox 64, based on Firefox 64 release information and <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1416839" rel="nofollow">Bug 1416839</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">These properties were already part of the <code class="notranslate">menus.update()</code> API surface, but were not represented as individual compatibility subfeatures in BCD.</p>
<p dir="auto">The three properties have therefore been added as separate subfeatures under <code class="notranslate">webextensions.api.menus.update</code>, following the existing BCD structure for WebExtensions API parameters and properties.</p>
<p dir="auto">For browser support values outside Firefox, the entries follow the existing BCD compatibility data and mirroring conventions. In particular, <code class="notranslate">safari_ios</code> is represented as <code class="notranslate">mirror</code> for <code class="notranslate">icons</code> and <code class="notranslate">viewTypes</code> where the BCD linter confirms that the value can be automatically mirrored from Safari.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #30615.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5544845808" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615">#30615</a></p>]]></content>
